{"id":"primer","lemma":"пример","pos":"noun","rank":1370,"glosses":["example, instance","sample math problem, math exercise, math task (in a math book)","praxis"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/df/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"примера","plural":"примеры"},"examples":[{"text":"Я должен показать пример.","en":"I have to set an example.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283322","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to show"},null]},{"text":"Вам нужны примеры?","en":"Do you need examples?","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null,null]},{"text":"Это был хороший пример.","en":"It was a good example.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"good, nice, fine"},null]},{"text":"Ты можешь найти какие-нибудь примеры?","en":"Can you think of any examples?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to find"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Покажи мне пример.","en":"Show me an example.","words":[{"g":"to show","l":"показать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]}]}